sn22.79:11.5 | S: “Suffering, sir.” | T: “Stressful, lord.”
sn22.79:11.6 | S: “But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: | T: “And is it fitting to regard what is inconstant, stressful, subject to change as:
